## Model card

- **Identity / release:** Primary **`LongCat-2.5-Preview`**,**2026-09-25**,not2.0,Flash-Thinking or a verified separate final2.5 checkpoint. Exact free route maps to this preview. The existing underscored `longcat_2.5_preview` metadata names the same OpenCode ID;spelling is not a second model identity. No peer findings read or folder merge performed.[1][5]
- **Access:** Native OpenAI-compatible **`https://api.longcat.chat/openai/v1/chat/completions`**,Anthropic Messages and documented Responses API. Current OpenCode model catalog returned200 and includes **`longcat-2.5-preview-free`**. Listing is not authenticated successful inference.[2][6]
- **Context / output:** Current native parameter table **1,048,576 total input+output /262,144 max output**,thinking budget up to262,144;OpenCode metadata **1,000,000/131,072**. Older generic native samples/secondary articles give128K output;current dedicated parameter table and actual serving route are kept distinct. No exact retrieval measurement verified.[3][5]
- **Modalities / thinking / tools:** Primary launch claims **text/image→text**,tools and reasoning. Native retrieval **example** still says text→text;it is not a live authenticated response,so inconsistency is explicit. Thinking enabled/disabled switch;temperature **1.0 on/0.7 off,fixed and overrides caller values**,top-p0.95 default. No native audio/video/generation inherited.[1][2][3]
- **Pricing (2026-10-21):** Native limited-time **$0.30 uncached input/$1.20 output/$0.006 cached per1M**. OpenCode exact route advertises **$0 input/output/cache**,limited-time,provider zero retention/no model training. No verified end date or unlimited-capacity guarantee. Pricing and feature flags cannot substitute for quality evidence.[4][5][6][7]
- **Architecture / licence / knowledge:** Exact total/active parameters,downloadable weights,weight licence and cutoff not verified. Fresh official HF2.5 search returned no matching weights;LongCat2.0's1.6T/48B/MIT are not transferred.[1][8]

